      <trans-unit id="s514bbfe7a6a1385a">
        <source>Each row needs to represent one set containing the features and the label. Seperate items with a comma (spaces before and after the comma are okay). The single last item always represents the label while the items before it represent the features. Make sure to use only dots and no commas for floating point values. If you have data in CSV format, you can just paste it here but make sure to remove any comments.</source>
        <target>每一行需要代表一个包含特征和标签的集合。用逗号分隔项目（逗号前后的空格也可）。最后一个项目总是代表标签，而前面的项目代表特征。浮点数值确保只用点，不用逗号。如果您有 CSV 格式的数据，可以直接粘贴到这里，但要确保删除任何注释。</target>
      </trans-unit>
